\"copy\">Explore CAA</span></p><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h1 class=\"gh-h gh-h--1 gh-pagehead__title\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">White City Ballroom</span></h1><p class=\"gh-lede gh-pagehead__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Floor-to-ceiling windows, vintage stained glass, an original Carrara marble floor, three 19th-century fireplaces, and 167 restored illuminated ceiling embellishments.</span></p></div></header><section id=\"look\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"look-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Look for this\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"look-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Look for this</span></h2></div><ol class=\"gh-docent\" aria-label=\"Look for this\"><li class=\"gh-docent__item\"><span class=\"gh-docent__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">01</span></span><span class=\"gh-docent__text\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Count the illuminated ceiling embellishments: the kit says 167 were restored.</span></span></li><li class=\"gh-docent__item\"><span class=\"gh-docent__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">02</span></span><span class=\"gh-docent__text\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The floor is original Carrara marble.</span></span></li><li class=\"gh-docent__item\"><span class=\"gh-docent__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">03</span></span><span class=\"gh-docent__text\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Three fireplaces date from the 19th century.</span></span></li></ol></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--alt\" aria-labelledby=\"features-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"What is in the room\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"features-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What is in the room</span></h2></div><div class=\"gh-prose\"><ul class=\"gh-list\"><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">floor-to-ceiling windows</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">vintage stained glass</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">original Carrara marble floor</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">three 19th-century fireplaces</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">167 restored illuminated ceiling embellishments</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id=\"capacity\" class=\"gh-section gh-section--default\" aria-labelledby=\"capacity-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Capacity (from the venue kit)\"><div class=\"gh-section__inner\"><div class=\"gh-section__head\"><hr class=\"gh-divider\" data-bl-s=\"\"><h2 id=\"capacity-title\" class=\"gh-h gh-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Capacity (from the venue kit)</span></h2></div><div class=\"gh-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The spaces below are the rooms the venue offers for weddings.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">which room hosts the ceremony, the cocktail hour, and the reception is not confirmed.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"gh-scroll\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Capacity figures\" tabindex=\"0\" data-bl-k=\"region\" data-bl-label=\"Capacity figures\"><table class=\"gh-table\"><caption class=\"gh-table__caption\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">These are the venue’s own kit figures; Sara and Tyler have not confirmed them with the planner yet.</span></caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Ceremony</span></th><th scope=\"col\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Dinner and dancing</span></th><th scope=\"col\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Reception</span></th></tr></thead>